{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-porto-playa","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"porto-playa-ellington-properties-mina-al-arab","about":"Porto Playa is a modern project by Ellington Properties located in Ras Al Khaimah on the Gulf. It is a residential complex of variable storey, with a thoughtful and planned design. The residence combines modern luxury with the natural beauty of the serene coastline and offers breathtaking sea views and pristine beaches. For sale are studios and apartments with 1,2 and 3 bedrooms, townhouses and villas. All residences have balconies, laundry rooms, built-in closets or closets. Interiors are made in a modern style with the use of delicate shades, which creates a cozy atmosphere. Panoramic windows are filled with sunlight, which visually expands the space and offers breathtaking views of the Persian Gulf.World-class amenities are provided for residents, including a gym with state-of-the-art equipment, swimming pool, yoga studio, children's play area, barbecue area, mini golf and the complex offers a variety of outdoor recreational opportunities.Porto Playa's convenient location allows residents quick access to key points in Ras Al Khaimah. InterContinental Mina Al Arab and Al Naeem Mall are just 5 minutes away, Rak Mall and Rak Hospital are 15 minutes away, and Ras Al Khaimah International Airport and Dhayah Fort are 20 minutes away. The only casino in the Emirates is also nearby.","price":4280828,"title":"Porto Playa","bitrix":{"id":637,"pf_id":"are.2.13042","source":null,"project_id":"Porto Playa","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Porto Playa","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Ellington Properties","project_location":"Mina Al Arab"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/380/images/2023/09/28/340x252/VrnhmTkeCX9jJYpX8FcSd8R1EwzezjUs7tFISNt7.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/